  # ── db/migrate — output of kiosk-server's install generator ────────────────
  #
  # These are not hand-written: `rails g kiosk:install` emits them
  # (kiosk-server/lib/generators/kiosk/install). A demo whose copy differs is a
  # demo that was not regenerated when the engine's schema moved — which is the
  # nastiest drift in this list, because it only surfaces as a runtime column
  # error in whichever demo nobody ran.
  #
